OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few isolated light showers,
OL,6,Fmainly early in the day and focused in
OL,7,Fthe west and far north, but many
OL,8,Fstaying dry, with the best of the
OL,9,Fafternoon highs in the east from
OL,10,FBelfast southwards. West to southwest
OL,11,Fbreezes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTurning unsettled with an
OL,14,Farea of occasionally heavy rain
OL,15,Freaching from the west by late
OL,16,Fevening, which persists overnight.
OL,17,FWesterly winds backing southerly
OL,18,Fovernight and occasionally freshening
OL,19,Faround the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
