OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FRather cloudy with some
OL,6,Frain, most persistent early in the
OL,7,Fday, turning progressively more patchy
OL,8,Fthrough the day, with some limited
OL,9,Fbrighter spells in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,12,Fmainly dry with light winds and sunny
OL,13,Fspells best in east. Monday wet and
OL,14,Foccasionally windy with the east in
OL,15,Fbest of shelter. Tuesday showery.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
